          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Balqees Raw Honey Store has become one of the most renowned suppliers of premium raw honey in the Middle East. With our passion for the product and proven success, we have now expanded our range across the UK and around the world. </p><p>We work with independent beekeepers and beekeeping cooperatives around the world who follow sustainable and ethical practices. With every purchase, you help support beekeepers and their families in rural communities locally and internationally.</p><p>All our raw honey comes straight from the hive. We never heat-treat or micro-filter it, and none of our beekeepers feed the bees sugar solutions or supplements. We are committed to providing the purest, most natural raw honey on earth. </p>"
          }
